IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `qld-schedule1-table`

-- Tests for the Schedule 1 table (qld-schedule1-table.l4).
-- The wording expected for each entry was found by a second, independent scan of the text of the entry's first line
-- (the earliest of the words means, includes, see, has the ... meaning, "is a", a dash or three dots), not by the routine that built the table.
-- They differ for one entry: the entry for the word "see", whose first line begins with the word "see" but which is defined by "means" (line 1438).

